<section>
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">1996</span>
        <h3>Founded in Bristol</h3>
        <p>Abatec opens its doors as a specialist engineering recruitment consultancy, serving the South West's growing manufacturing base.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">2004</span>
        <h3>Civil engineering desk launches</h3>
        <p>As regional infrastructure investment accelerates, Abatec builds a dedicated civil engineering and construction team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">2011</span>
        <h3>REC &amp; Constructionline accreditation</h3>
        <p>Formal accreditation cements Abatec's position as a compliant, trusted supplier to tier-one contractors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">2016</span>
        <h3>IT recruitment desk established</h3>
        <p>Responding to client demand, Abatec extends its specialist model into software, infrastructure and IT leadership recruitment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">2020</span>
        <h3>Disability Confident Employer status</h3>
        <p>Abatec formalises its commitment to inclusive recruitment practice, both internally and in the hiring processes it runs for clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__item">
        <span class="timeline__year">2026</span>
        <h3>30 years, and building the next chapter</h3>
        <p>Over 4,200 placements later, Abatec continues to specialise where it matters most: engineering, industrial, civil and IT recruitment across the UK South West.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

