        <h3>Specialism over scale</h3>
        <p>We'd rather be the best in four sectors than mediocre across twenty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Honesty, even when it's awkward</h3>
        <p>We tell clients when a brief is unrealistic, and candidates when a role isn't the right fit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Compliance as standard</h3>
        <p>Right-to-work, insurance and site compliance are built into every process, not bolted on.</p>
